  (text "Rails: BP1 +456 (post-choke) · BP2 +430 screens · BP3 +410 (PI, driven anchor) · BDRV +480 (driver, driven anchor) · BD +300 (preamp, driven anchor) · bias -55 V" (at 12.7 264.047 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "88b1300f-8f52-559f-a1ac-1f12b68fd7b4"))
  (text "Heaters, PT primary/mains, pilot lamp and chassis switches are omitted here — see the netlist, the sources list and the board drawing. BP3/BDRV/BD are DRIVEN anchors, not derived through the dropper chain shown (see the circuit story)." (at 12.7 268.447 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "806116fc-d153-52cb-8f66-a352896fd43b"))
  (text "Channel-mixing node — both channels sum here; the tremolo photocell (below) also shunts it" (at 12.7 272.847 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "76176bfb-05dd-5f4c-a07c-cbd3c750d32b"))
  (text "Driver — local feedback network read from the drawing but not confidently resolved (schematic-only; see the circuit story and the parts list)" (at 12.7 277.247 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "fa4f19bb-dd36-54e2-88a1-b8aae935fafe"))
  (text "The tremolo oscillator drives a lamp/photoresistor pair (OPTO) whose photocell shunts the channel-mixing node (see the circuit story)." (at 12.7 281.647 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "48329a5e-fd6b-5903-a8d3-cede2ee0cb7b"))
  (text "Phase-shift ladder values (RTOG1/RTOG2/CTO1-3) are a schematic-only reading, typical of this circuit family — not confidently resolved from the scan (see the parts list)." (at 12.7 286.047 0)
